            <note corresp="#d604-f4" n="68" xml:id="d604-f4-content">
                <p>The construction of six river gunboats was authorized by an act of Congress
                    approved Dec. 18, 1924 (43 Stat. 719). These gunboats were completed in 1928
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Annual Reports of the Navy Department for the
                        Fiscal Year</hi>, etc., 1928, p. 277).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
